        "@value": "March Drinks with Designers"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "ADC Drinks with Designers is an informal hangout for anyone who works in theatrical design or who would like to learn more about the Vancouver design community. Come and have a snack or a drink and socialize with people who are in the same boat as you."
      }
